#4471 merged **412 unique reports** about dates. The export contains 427 rows, including 15 duplicate report IDs.

## Problems and report counts

| Problem | Reports | Resolution |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| Shared parser flips day-first dates | **379** | Fixed: `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales` |
| booking-v3 date hint conflicts with day-first tenant locales | **33** | Won't fix: booking-v3 form retired |

The parser group spans 11 day-first tenants and includes reports from app (204), email (150), and form (25). The hint group covers Alder Physio, Copper Studio, and Pale Harbour; all 33 arrived through booking-v3 forms. Intake tags do not establish cause: some reports were tagged differently from their tenant/form cause.

## Desk update · 5 October

The desk closed #4471 on 5 October. Engineering fixed the shared parser with commit `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`. The desk won't fix the hint issue because it retired the booking-v3 form.

